  invite    一条命令把这台配成「手」:自动开 A2A 监听 + 重启 + 出配对码(在 HAND 那台跑)                                  
    join    Join a hand using its pairing code — auto-registers both sides (run on the BRAIN)
    list    Show paired hands (you can delegate to) and brains (can delegate here)           
    ping    Check whether paired hands are reachable (fetches each hand's Agent Card)        
